'''Log''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 5]] or through trading.
== Appearance ==
It’s blade is brown in color and resembles the tree bark of a log, hence the name. The guard and handle are both solid black.
